  next_move_intent:        { consumers: ["sphere_of_influence"],                  disposition: "handled", kind: "handoff",    what: "a LIFETIME customer TAPPED a self-directed 'Your Next Move' option in their portal (move up / right-size / invest / refinance / improve / explore) — a client-INITIATED re-transaction intent, the cleanest and most compliant lead signal there is (equity/tenure only, never protected-class targeting). The AI ISA (who hears the client) HANDS it to the Sphere Manager (lifetime relationship owner), who escalates a HIGH-priority follow-up to the responsible agent with the concrete delegated next step (buyer consult + CMA for move-up / finance review for refinance / vendor intro for improve). Turns a passive past-client portal into a re-transaction funnel — idempotent per (contact, intent) within the open window" },
